{%- doc -%}
  Bespoke, conversion-focused product page for "Pack Alarme Maison sans Fil
  Elite (Zenguard) PA570" (499,90 €, SKU PA570, templateSuffix "pa570")

  Structural fork of sections/product-vig503-landing.liquid — same
  Apple-style rhythm, same shared hidden cart form + pv-atc-button /
  pv-trust-row snippets, same sticky bar and Alma modal — so the Élite
  pages read as the same store as the Vigilia ones. The range is signalled
  by a warm sand hero and a bronze accent rather than a dark slab: an
  earlier graphite version was rejected by the merchant as too dark, and
  it fought the product photography, which is shot on white.

  Four things are new, and they are the point of the fork:

  1. A continuity matrix (three situations × five functions), so a
     visitor compares outage scenarios without clicking anything. It
     replaces a tabbed simulator the merchant found unclear.
  2. A carte SIM M2M module, sourced verbatim from the merchant-authored
     description of product SIM1ANPA ("Carte SIM M2M Afone 1 An Prépayé -
     Pour centrale Élite").
  3. A Zigbee 3.0 module, held to what the merchant has confirmed: no
     mesh routing (the pack's sensors are battery end devices and don't
     relay), no comparison against 433 MHz radio (it reads as an attack
     on the merchant's own Vigilia and Touch ranges), and no automation
     scenarios (unconfirmed, so out). The EXT501ZIG amplifier extends
     the ZIGBEE network only — not the SA501 RF accessories the centrale
     also accepts. Third-party devices need Zigbee 3.0 AND Tuya, and
     even then non-Daewoo accessories carry no guarantee.
  4. An accessory picker whose steppers re-price every CTA on the page.

  Two facts are deliberately NOT taken from this product's own current
  descriptionHtml, which contradicts the two fiches above and was flagged
  to the merchant, who confirmed both corrections:
  - Cameras are Wi-Fi only. With a SIM installed and the box down, the APP
    stays usable (that is the single difference with Vigilia/Touch, where
    the SIM only carries SMS and calls) — the camera streams do NOT.
    The PA570 description currently claims "accès aux caméras maintenu".
  - Backup battery is 10 h (DAPA501Z fiche), not the 12 h the PA570
    description claims. Merchant confirmed 10 h "par sécurité".

  Single-variant product, so no connectivity toggle and no PVData blob:
  everything the VIG503 fork needed for its Wi-Fi / Wi-Fi+GSM switch is
  dropped here.

  No rating badge and no reviews section: the 68 curated reviews reused
  across the Vigilia pages are Vigilia-family reviews and do not apply to
  the Élite. To be wired to real Élite reviews before this goes live.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign form_id = 'PEForm-' | append: section.id
  assign hero_img_id = 'PEHeroImg-' | append: section.id

  assign variant_has_compare = false
  if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price
    assign variant_has_compare = true
  endif

  assign gallery = product.images
  assign hero_image = product.featured_image | default: gallery[0]

  # Les photos des blocs viennent des fiches des caméras, pas de la galerie
  # du pack : celle-ci ne porte que des infographies ("W503_Infographie",
  # "IP506_Infographie") qu'une recherche par nom de fichier plaçait à la
  # place d'une photo. On cherche dans la galerie de la caméra la vue qui
  # illustre la promesse du bloc, avec repli sur sa photo principale.
  assign cam_ext = all_products['camera-daewoo-w503-autonome-haute-resolution-wifi-1080p']
  assign feat_image_1 = cam_ext.featured_image | default: hero_image
  for img in cam_ext.images
    if img.src contains 'w503-sans-fil'
      assign feat_image_1 = img
    endif
  endfor

  assign cam_int = all_products['camera-interieure-rotative-ip506p']
  assign feat_image_2 = cam_int.featured_image | default: hero_image
  for img in cam_int.images
    if img.src contains 'ip506p-mode-vie-privee'
      assign feat_image_2 = img
    endif
  endfor

  # Cross-sell: the "compare the range" card is illustrated with the
  # centrale itself. It was the only card of the pair without a photo.
  assign centrale = all_products['strong-centrale-dalarme-strong-elite']
  assign centrale_image = centrale.featured_image

  # Renvoi latéral : le pack voisin, cherché par handle pour avoir sa vraie
  # photo et son prix du jour plutôt qu'un chiffre figé. Les packs renvoient
  # vers le Starter, le Starter renvoie vers le premier pack avec caméras.
  assign starter_pack = all_products['starter-pack-elite-daewoo']
  assign starter_pack_image = starter_pack.featured_image
  assign starter_pack_price = starter_pack.price_min

  # Upsell: the M2M SIM card designed for this centrale (200 Mo envelope,
  # not the 50 Mo standard one). Same treatment — live price, real link.
  assign sim_card = all_products['carte-sim-m2m-afone-1-an-prepaye-pour-centrale-pa501z']
  assign sim_price = sim_card.price_min

  # Accessory picker. Looked up by handle so price, photo, stock and
  # variant id all come from the catalogue rather than being frozen into
  # the page. Anything unavailable simply doesn't render its card.
  #
  # Le marchand avait demandé un "WSD502Z" : cette référence n'existe pas
  # au catalogue. Il a confirmé le WSD501, détecteur de fumée de la gamme
  # SA501 compatible avec la centrale Élite. C'est le seul des quatre
  # accessoires proposés qui soit en radio et non en Zigbee.
  assign acc_handles = 'amplificateur-dondes-zigbee-pour-centrale-pa501z,contacteur-de-porte-zigbee-wds502z-compatible-avec-la-centrale-pa501z,detecteur-de-vibration-zigbee-wvd502z-compatible-avec-la-centrale-pa501z,detecteur-de-fumee-wsd501-pour-alarme-daewoo-sa501' | split: ','

  # Note et nombre d'avis, lus en direct depuis les métachamps que Judge.me
  # synchronise sur chaque produit. Les avis de la gamme Élite sont rattachés
  # aux six packs comme au Starter Pack, d'où la même note partout — rien
  # n'est recopié dans la page : un nouvel avis s'y reflète tout seul.
  assign rating_mf = product.metafields.reviews.rating
  assign rating_count_mf = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count
  assign has_rating = false
  if rating_mf != blank and rating_count_mf.value > 0
    assign has_rating = true
    assign rating_value = rating_mf.value.rating
    assign rating_max = rating_mf.value.scale_max
    assign rating_count = rating_count_mf.value
    assign rating_pct = rating_value | times: 100.0 | divided_by: rating_max
  endif
  assign reviews_anchor = 'PEReviews-' | append: section.id
-%}

<div id="shopify-section-{{ section.id }}" class="pv">
  <style>
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pv{
      --pv-navy:#0c1e4a;
      --pv-navy-dark:#081430;
      --pv-ink:#1d1d1f;
      --pv-gray:#6e6e73;
      --pv-bg-alt:#f5f5f7;
      --pv-line:#d2d2d7;
      --pv-success:#037e05;
      font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Display","Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
      color:var(--pv-ink);
      background:#fff;
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }
    .pv *{box-sizing:border-box;}
    .pv .pv-wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
    .pv img{max-width:100%;display:block;}

    /* ---- sticky bar ---- */
    .pv-sticky{
      position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
      padding:12px 20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
      border-top:1px solid var(--pv-line);
      transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .35s ease;
    }
    .pv-sticky.is-shown{transform:translateY(0);}
    .pv-sticky__info{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:0;}
    .pv-sticky__thumb{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);}
    .pv-sticky__thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
    .pv-sticky__text{min-width:0;}
    .pv-sticky__name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:34vw;}
    .pv-sticky__toggle{display:none;}
    @media (min-width:640px){.pv-sticky__toggle{display:block;}}

    /* ---- generic section rhythm ---- */
    .pv-section{padding:72px 0;}
    .pv-section--alt{background:var(--pv-bg-alt);}
    .pv-eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--pv-navy);margin-bottom:18px;
    }
    .pv-eyebrow::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pv-success);}
    .pv-ref{font-weight:700;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    dd.pv-ref{display:block;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;}
    .pv h1,.pv h2,.pv h3{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.08;margin:0;}
    .pv p{margin:0;}

    /* ---- hero ---- */
    .pv-hero{padding:96px 0 56px;text-align:center;}
    .pv-hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;}
    .pv .pv-hero__tagline{font-size:clamp(18px,2.6vw,26px);color:var(--pv-navy);max-width:820px;margin:14px auto 0;font-weight:500;font-style:italic;text-align:center;}
    .pv .pv-hero__summary{font-size:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);max-width:660px;margin:12px auto 0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;}
    .pv .pv-hero__sub{
      font-size:clamp(17px,2.2vw,22px);color:var(--pv-gray);
      max-width:660px;margin:22px auto 0;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;text-align:center;
    }
    .pv-hero__cta{margin-top:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
    .pv-hero__price{font-size:15px;color:var(--pv-gray);}
    .pv-hero__price strong{color:var(--pv-ink);font-size:17px;}
    .pv-price-compare{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-right:6px;display:none;}
    .pv-price-compare.is-visible{display:inline;}
    /* ---- rating badge (links down to the reviews section) ---- */
    .pv-rating-badge{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;
      background:var(--pv-bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:999px;
      padding:8px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-ink);
      transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;
    }
    .pv-rating-badge:hover{background:#ececee;border-color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-rating-badge__stars{position:relative;display:inline-block;font-size:14px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--pv-line);}
    .pv-rating-badge__stars-bg{display:block;}
    .pv-rating-badge__stars-fg{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;color:#f5a623;}
    .pv-rating-badge__score{font-weight:700;}
    .pv-rating-badge__sep{color:var(--pv-line);}
    .pv-rating-badge__count{color:var(--pv-gray);}
    .pv-rating-badge__chevron{color:var(--pv-gray);flex-shrink:0;}

    /* ---- payment badges ---- */
    .pv-pay{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;}
    .pv-pay__methods{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;}
    .pv-pay__icon{height:22px;width:auto;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--pv-line);}
    .pv-pay__alma{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;
      border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;
      cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:border-color .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease;
    }
    .pv-pay__alma:hover{border-color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-pay__alma:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--pv-navy);outline-offset:2px;}
    .pv-pay__alma-logo{height:20px;width:auto;display:block;}
    .pv-pay__alma-text{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-weight:500;}
    .pv-pay__alma-info{color:var(--pv-line);flex-shrink:0;}

    /* ---- Alma installments modal ---- */
    .pv-modal{
      border:none;border-radius:24px;padding:0;max-width:420px;width:calc(100% - 40px);
      box-shadow:0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.35);color:var(--pv-ink);
    }
    .pv-modal::backdrop{background:rgba(8,20,48,.55);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(2px);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);}
    .pv-modal__inner{
      position:relative;padding:32px 28px 28px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px) scale(.97);
      transition:opacity .28s ease,transform .28s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
    }
    .pv-modal.is-open .pv-modal__inner{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
    .pv-modal__close{
      position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;width:32px;height:32px;border:none;border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--pv-bg-alt);color:var(--pv-ink);cursor:pointer;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    }
    .pv-modal__close:hover{background:var(--pv-line);}
    .pv-alma-badge-lg{
      display:block;height:30px;width:auto;margin-bottom:10px;
    }
    .pv-modal h3{font-size:21px;}
    .pv-modal__inner > p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;}
    .pv-alma-plans{margin-top:22px;display:grid;gap:10px;}
    .pv-alma-plan{
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;
      padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:14px;
    }
    .pv-alma-plan__title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;}
    .pv-alma-plan__note{font-size:12px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:2px;}
    .pv-alma-plan__amount{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;}
    .pv-modal__legal{margin-top:20px;font-size:12px;color:var(--pv-gray);line-height:1.5;}

    .pv-hero__rating{margin-top:6px;}
    .pv-hero__trust{
      margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px 22px;
      font-size:13px;color:var(--pv-gray);
    }
    .pv-hero__trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
    .pv-hero__media{margin-top:56px;}
    .pv-hero__media img{
      width:100%;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:28px;
      background:var(--pv-bg-alt);
    }

    /* ---- small photo carousel under the hero image ---- */
    .pv-thumbs{
      display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin:18px auto 0;max-width:640px;
      overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 2px 6px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
    }
    .pv-thumbs__item{
      flex-shrink:0;width:56px;height:56px;padding:0;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;
      background:var(--pv-bg-alt);border:2px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;
      opacity:.6;transition:opacity .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;
    }
    .pv-thumbs__item img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
    .pv-thumbs__item:hover{opacity:.9;}
    .pv-thumbs__item.is-active{opacity:1;border-color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-thumbs__item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--pv-navy);outline-offset:2px;}

    /* ---- buttons ---- */
    .pv-btn{
      position:relative;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
      border:none;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
      font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;
      padding:15px 30px;min-width:230px;
      transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,opacity .15s ease;
    }
    .pv-btn:active{transform:scale(.98);}
    .pv-btn[disabled]{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;}
    .pv-btn--primary{background:var(--pv-navy);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -8px rgba(12,30,74,.55);}
    .pv-btn--primary .btn-fill{background:var(--pv-navy-dark);}
    .pv-btn--secondary{background:var(--pv-ink);color:#fff;}
    .pv-btn--secondary .btn-fill{background:#000;}
    .pv-btn .btn-fill{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;transform:translateY(100%);}
    .pv-btn__text{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
    .pv-btn--ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--pv-navy);border:1.5px solid var(--pv-navy);padding:13px 28px;box-shadow:none;min-width:0;}
    .pv-btn--sm{min-width:0;padding:11px 22px;font-size:14px;}

    /* ---- connectivity toggle ---- */
    .pv-toggle{display:inline-flex;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;gap:4px;}
    .pv-toggle__btn{
      border:none;background:transparent;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;
      font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-gray);cursor:pointer;
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap;
      transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease;
    }
    .pv-toggle__btn.is-selected{background:var(--pv-navy);color:#fff;}
    .pv-toggle__badge{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;background:#e11d48;color:#fff;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;}
    .pv-toggle--compact{padding:3px;}
    .pv-toggle--compact .pv-toggle__btn{padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;}
    .pv-hero__toggle{margin-bottom:4px;}
    .pv-band__toggle,.pv-final__toggle{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:26px;}
    .pv-band .pv-toggle{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);}
    .pv-band .pv-toggle__btn{color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);}
    .pv-band .pv-toggle__btn.is-selected{background:#fff;color:var(--pv-navy);}

    /* ---- trust strip ---- */
    .pv-strip{
      display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:14px;
      padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-line);
    }
    .pv-strip__item{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;
      padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);
    }
    .pv-strip__item svg{color:var(--pv-navy);flex-shrink:0;}

    /* ---- pack contents ---- */
    .pv-contents__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 44px;}
    .pv-contents__head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);}
    .pv-contents__head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:17px;}
    .pv-contents__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--pv-line);border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;}
    .pv-contents__item{background:#fff;padding:22px 24px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;}
    .pv-contents__qty{flex-shrink:0;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pv-navy);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
    .pv-contents__name{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;}
    .pv-contents__desc{margin-top:4px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);line-height:1.5;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.pv-contents__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}

    /* ---- connectivity comparison ---- */
    .pv-compare__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
    .pv-compare__head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);}
    .pv-compare__head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:17px;}
    .pv-compare__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;max-width:840px;margin:0 auto;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.pv-compare__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
    .pv-compare__card{
      position:relative;display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;
      border:2px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:20px;padding:28px 26px;background:#fff;
      font-family:inherit;transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;
    }
    .pv-compare__card:hover{border-color:#b9bcc7;}
    .pv-compare__card.is-selected{border-color:var(--pv-navy);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(12,30,74,.08);}
    .pv-compare__radio{position:absolute;top:26px;right:26px;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--pv-line);}
    .pv-compare__card.is-selected .pv-compare__radio{border-color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-compare__card.is-selected .pv-compare__radio::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-compare__badge{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#e11d48;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:.02em;}
    .pv-compare__name{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;padding-right:32px;}
    .pv-compare__card ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px;}
    .pv-compare__card ul li{display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pv-compare__card ul li svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;color:var(--pv-success);}
    .pv-compare__price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--pv-line);}
    .pv-compare__price strong{font-size:22px;}
    .pv-compare__note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--pv-gray);margin:0 0 16px;padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:8px;}

    /* ---- features ---- */
    .pv-feature{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;
      padding:64px 0;
    }
    .pv-feature__media img{border-radius:24px;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);}
    .pv-feature__num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pv-navy);letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:14px;display:block;}
    .pv-feature h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);}
    .pv-feature__text{margin-top:18px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;max-width:480px;}
    .pv-feature ul{list-style:none;margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:12px;max-width:480px;}
    .pv-feature ul li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pv-feature ul li svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;color:var(--pv-success);}
    @media (min-width:900px){
      .pv-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;}
      .pv-feature--reverse .pv-feature__media{order:2;}
      .pv-feature--reverse .pv-feature__body{order:1;}
    }

    /* ---- mid CTA band ---- */
    .pv-band{
      background:var(--pv-navy);color:#fff;border-radius:28px;
      padding:56px 32px;text-align:center;margin:24px 0;
    }
    .pv-band h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;}
    .pv-band p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);margin-top:14px;font-size:16px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
    .pv-band .pv-btn{margin-top:26px;background:#fff;color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-band .pv-btn .btn-fill{background:#e9e9ee;}

    /* ---- specs ---- */
    .pv-specs__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px;}
    .pv-specs__head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);}
    .pv-specs__head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:17px;}
    .pv-specs__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--pv-line);border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;}
    .pv-specs__item{background:#fff;padding:24px 28px;}
    .pv-specs__item dt{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pv-navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:8px;}
    .pv-specs__item dd{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--pv-ink);line-height:1.5;white-space:pre-line;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.pv-specs__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
    @media (min-width:1000px){.pv-specs__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;}}

    /* ---- guarantee band ---- */
    .pv-guarantee{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;text-align:center;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.pv-guarantee{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
    .pv-guarantee__item{padding:0 12px;}
    .pv-guarantee__item svg{color:var(--pv-navy);margin:0 auto 14px;display:block;}
    .pv-guarantee__item h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;}
    .pv-guarantee__item p{margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);line-height:1.5;}

    /* ---- cross-sell ---- */
    .pv-crosssell__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
    .pv-crosssell__head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);}
    .pv-crosssell__head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:17px;}
    .pv-crosssell__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;max-width:840px;margin:0 auto;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.pv-crosssell__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
    .pv-crosssell__card{
      border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:24px;padding:32px 28px;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;background:#fff;
    }
    .pv-crosssell__icon{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-crosssell__card h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;}
    .pv-crosssell__card p{color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;flex-grow:1;}
    .pv-crosssell__card .pv-btn{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:4px;}
    a.pv-crosssell__card{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;}
    a.pv-crosssell__card:hover{border-color:#b9bcc7;box-shadow:0 12px 28px -16px rgba(12,30,74,.18);}
    .pv-crosssell__card--photo{padding:0;overflow:hidden;gap:0;}
    .pv-crosssell__photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);}
    .pv-crosssell__card--photo .pv-crosssell__body{padding:22px 26px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex-grow:1;}
    .pv-crosssell__price{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pv-ink);margin-top:2px;}
    .pv-crosssell__price span{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-left:2px;}
    .pv-crosssell__card--photo .pv-btn{margin-top:10px;}

    /* ---- reviews ---- */
    .pv-reviews__head{text-align:center;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 36px;}
    .pv-reviews__head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin-top:14px;}
    .pv-reviews__summary{
      margin-top:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      font-size:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);
    }
    .pv-reviews__summary strong{color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pv-reviews__track{
      display:flex;gap:20px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;
      padding:4px 4px 18px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
    }
    .pv-review-card{
      scroll-snap-align:start;flex-shrink:0;width:min(280px,80vw);
      background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:20px;padding:26px;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;
    }
    .pv-review-card__stars{color:#f5a623;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;}
    .pv-review-card__text{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--pv-ink);flex:1;}
    .pv-review-card__text::before{content:"“";}
    .pv-review-card__text::after{content:"”";}
    .pv-review-card__meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--pv-gray);}
    .pv-review-card__name{font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pv-review-card__dot{width:3px;height:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pv-line);flex-shrink:0;}
    .pv-reviews__all-btn{
      margin-top:16px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-navy);
      background:none;border:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer;padding:4px;
    }

    /* ---- full reviews list (inside modal) ---- */
    .pv-modal--reviews .pv-modal__inner{max-height:min(640px,80vh);display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
    .pv-all-reviews{margin-top:16px;overflow-y:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-right:4px;}
    .pv-all-review{border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-line);padding-bottom:16px;}
    .pv-all-review:last-child{border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0;}
    .pv-all-review__stars{color:#f5a623;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;}
    .pv-all-review__text{margin-top:6px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pv-all-review__meta{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--pv-gray);}
    .pv-all-review__meta strong{color:var(--pv-ink);font-weight:600;}
    .pv-all-reviews__loading{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);}

    /* ---- faq ---- */
    .pv-faq{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;}
    .pv-faq h2{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin-bottom:40px;}
    .pv-faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-line);padding:20px 0;}
    .pv-faq summary{
      cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;
      font-size:17px;font-weight:500;
    }
    .pv-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
    .pv-faq summary .pv-faq__icon{flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .25s ease;color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pv-faq details[open] summary .pv-faq__icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
    .pv-faq__a{margin-top:14px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;max-width:660px;}

    /* ---- final cta ---- */
    .pv-final{text-align:center;}
    .pv-final h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;}
    .pv-final p{margin-top:16px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:17px;}
    .pv-final__ctas{margin-top:32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;justify-content:center;}
    .pv-final__legal{margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--pv-gray);}

    /* ---- sales appointment CTA (between FAQ and final CTA — the point
       where a hesitant visitor who still has questions is about to
       leave, rather than competing with the primary "Ajouter au
       panier" CTAs elsewhere on the page) ---- */
    .pv-appt{
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:20px;
      max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 32px;border-radius:24px;
      background:var(--pv-bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--pv-line);
    }
    @media (min-width:700px){
      .pv-appt{flex-direction:row;text-align:left;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;max-width:820px;}
    }
    .pv-appt__eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-success);margin-bottom:6px;}
    .pv-appt h3{font-size:clamp(19px,2.4vw,23px);}
    .pv-appt__sub{margin-top:8px;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;max-width:400px;}
    .pv-appt .pv-btn{flex-shrink:0;}

    /* ---- reveal-on-scroll ---- */
    .pv-reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease;}
    .pv-reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:none;}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .pv-reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;}
      .pv-sticky{transition:none;}
    }

    /* ============================================================
       ÉLITE — additions on top of the shared Vigilia page styles.
       Everything below is prefixed .pe- so it can't collide with the
       .pv- rules above, which stay byte-identical across both ranges.

       Palette: the range is signalled by a warm sand ground and a
       bronze accent rather than a dark slab — the product photography
       is shot on white, and a dark hero fought it. Two functional
       accents carry meaning and nothing else: violet = Zigbee,
       amber = 4G. The navy CTA band stays the only dark block on the
       page, exactly as on the Vigilia pages.
       ============================================================ */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .pv{
      --pe-sand:#f7f2e8;
      --pe-sand-2:#fdfbf7;
      --pe-bronze:#8a6a2f;
      --pe-bronze-soft:#b9954f;
      --pe-bronze-line:#e4d7bb;
      --pe-zig:#6d4fd1;
      --pe-zig-bg:#f4f1ff;
      --pe-zig-line:#d9cffa;
      --pe-zig-ink:#3d2a86;
      --pe-amber:#b06f10;
      --pe-amber-bg:#fdf3e3;
      --pe-amber-line:#eccfa0;
      --pe-amber-ink:#6b4207;
      --pe-eth:#1f6f3f;
      --pe-eth-bg:#eaf4ed;
      --pe-danger:#a11b1b;
      --pe-danger-bg:#fdf3f3;
    }

    /* ---- eyebrow variants ---- */
    .pv .pe-eyebrow--zig{color:var(--pe-zig-ink);}
    .pv .pe-eyebrow--zig::before{background:var(--pe-zig);}
    .pv .pe-eyebrow--amber{color:var(--pe-amber-ink);}
    .pv .pe-eyebrow--amber::before{background:var(--pe-amber);}
    .pv .pe-eyebrow--bronze{color:var(--pe-bronze);}
    .pv .pe-eyebrow--bronze::before{background:var(--pe-bronze-soft);}

    /* ---- hero: warm sand ground, ink type, bronze hairline ---- */
    .pe-hero{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--pe-sand-2) 0%,var(--pe-sand) 100%);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--pe-bronze-line);
    }
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-eyebrow{color:var(--pe-bronze);}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-eyebrow::before{background:var(--pe-bronze-soft);}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__tagline{color:var(--pe-bronze);font-style:normal;}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__media img{background:#fff;}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-thumbs__item{background:#fff;}

    .pe-hero__chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:26px;}
    .pe-chip{
      font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;
      background:#fff;color:var(--pe-bronze);border:1px solid var(--pe-bronze-line);
    }
    .pe-chip--zig{background:var(--pe-zig-bg);border-color:var(--pe-zig-line);color:var(--pe-zig-ink);}
    .pe-chip--eth{background:var(--pe-eth-bg);border-color:#bcdcc8;color:var(--pe-eth);}
    .pe-chip--4g{background:var(--pe-amber-bg);border-color:var(--pe-amber-line);color:var(--pe-amber-ink);}

    /* ---- Zigbee badge on the pack-contents rows ---- */
    .pe-zigtag{
      display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
      letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--pe-zig-bg);color:var(--pe-zig-ink);
    }

    /* ---- centrale anatomy: 4 network rails + spec grid ---- */
    .pe-anat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px;align-items:center;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.pe-anat{grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr;gap:48px;}}
    .pe-rails{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
    .pe-rail{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;
      border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;background:#fff;
    }
    @media (min-width:520px){.pe-rail{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;}}
    .pe-rail__ic{
      width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;flex-shrink:0;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    }
    .pe-rail__t{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;}
    .pv .pe-rail__d{font-size:13px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5;}
    .pe-rail__rank{
      font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;
      padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;justify-self:start;margin-top:8px;
    }
    @media (min-width:520px){.pe-rail__rank{margin-top:0;justify-self:end;}}
    .pe-rail--eth{border-color:#bcdcc8;}
    .pe-rail--eth .pe-rail__ic,.pe-rail--eth .pe-rail__rank{background:var(--pe-eth-bg);color:var(--pe-eth);}
    .pe-rail--wifi .pe-rail__ic,.pe-rail--wifi .pe-rail__rank{background:#e8f0fa;color:var(--pv-navy);}
    .pe-rail--4g{border-color:var(--pe-amber-line);}
    .pe-rail--4g .pe-rail__ic{background:var(--pe-amber-bg);color:var(--pe-amber);}
    .pe-rail--4g .pe-rail__rank{background:var(--pe-amber-bg);color:var(--pe-amber-ink);}
    .pe-rail--zig{border-color:var(--pe-zig-line);}
    .pe-rail--zig .pe-rail__ic{background:var(--pe-zig-bg);color:var(--pe-zig);}
    .pe-rail--zig .pe-rail__rank{background:var(--pe-zig-bg);color:var(--pe-zig-ink);}

    .pe-specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--pv-line);border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;}
    @media (min-width:520px){.pe-specs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
    .pe-spec{background:#fff;padding:20px 22px;}
    .pe-spec__k{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pv-gray);font-weight:700;}
    .pe-spec__v{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin-top:7px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
    .pv .pe-spec__n{font-size:13px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5;}

    /* ---- continuity matrix: what still works, in one look ----
       Replaces the tabbed simulator: three situations side by side, so
       nothing has to be clicked to be compared. The first column is
       sticky so the row label stays readable while the matrix scrolls
       sideways on a phone. */
    .pe-matrix{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:18px;background:#fff;}
    .pe-matrix table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:640px;}
    .pe-matrix th,.pe-matrix td{padding:16px 18px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-line);}
    .pe-matrix tbody tr:last-child th,.pe-matrix tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
    .pe-matrix thead th{
      font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pv-ink);line-height:1.4;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-ink);background:var(--pv-bg-alt);vertical-align:bottom;
    }
    .pe-matrix thead th span{display:block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-gray);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;margin-top:5px;}
    .pe-matrix tbody th{
      font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-ink);
      position:sticky;left:0;background:#fff;min-width:200px;
      box-shadow:1px 0 0 var(--pv-line);
    }
    .pe-matrix thead th:first-child{position:sticky;left:0;background:var(--pv-bg-alt);box-shadow:1px 0 0 var(--pv-line);z-index:1;}
    .pe-state{display:inline-flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;}
    .pe-state svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;}
    .pe-state--ok{color:var(--pv-success);}
    .pe-state--ko{color:var(--pe-danger);}
    .pe-state__note{display:block;color:var(--pv-gray);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:3px;}
    .pe-matrix__foot{
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;
      border-left:3px solid var(--pe-amber);background:var(--pe-amber-bg);
      padding:16px 18px;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;
    }
    .pv .pe-matrix__foot p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--pe-amber-ink);}
    .pv .pe-matrix__foot p strong{color:#4d2f05;}

    /* ---- yes / no panels ---- */
    .pe-duo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;}
    @media (min-width:760px){.pe-duo{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
    .pe-panel{border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px;background:#fff;}
    .pe-panel--yes{border-color:#bcdcc8;background:#f6fbf7;}
    .pe-panel--no{border-color:#e3c9c9;background:var(--pe-danger-bg);}
    .pe-panel h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
    .pe-panel ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:18px 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
    .pe-panel li{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pe-panel li svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;}
    .pe-panel--yes li svg{color:var(--pv-success);}
    .pe-panel--no li svg{color:var(--pe-danger);}

    /* ---- two-column explainer + aside ---- */
    .pe-why{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;align-items:start;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.pe-why{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px;}}
    .pe-why h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
    .pv .pe-why p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:14px;}
    .pe-warn{border-left:3px solid var(--pe-amber);background:var(--pe-amber-bg);padding:18px 20px;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;}
    .pv .pe-warn p{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--pe-amber-ink);margin:0;}
    .pv .pe-warn p + p{margin-top:12px;}
    .pe-warn--zig{border-left-color:var(--pe-zig);background:var(--pe-zig-bg);}
    .pv .pe-warn--zig p{color:var(--pe-zig-ink);}

    /* ---- tables ---- */
    .pe-table{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
    .pe-table table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:560px;font-size:14.5px;}
    .pe-table caption{
      text-align:left;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--pv-gray);font-weight:700;padding-bottom:14px;
    }
    .pe-table th,.pe-table td{padding:15px 16px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-line);vertical-align:top;line-height:1.5;}
    .pe-table thead th{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pv-gray);font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pv-ink);}
    .pe-table tbody th{font-weight:600;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pe-table td.pe-num{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600;}
    .pv .pe-table__note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:16px;}

    /* ---- checklist ---- */
    .pe-check{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;}
    @media (min-width:760px){.pe-check{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px 32px;}}
    .pe-check li{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pe-check svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;color:var(--pv-navy);}

    /* ---- Zigbee: what the protocol actually covers ---- */
    .pe-zigband{background:var(--pe-zig-bg);border-block:1px solid var(--pe-zig-line);}
    .pe-zig3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:40px;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.pe-zig3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}}
    .pe-zig3__card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--pe-zig-line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;}
    .pe-zig3__ic{
      width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      background:var(--pe-zig-bg);color:var(--pe-zig);margin-bottom:16px;
    }
    .pe-zig3__card h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
    .pv .pe-zig3__card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:8px;}

    /* ---- accessory picker: cards with a stepper that re-prices the page ---- */
    .pe-acc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;}
    @media (min-width:600px){.pe-acc{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
    @media (min-width:1000px){.pe-acc{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
    .pe-acc__card{
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;
      transition:border-color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;
    }
    .pe-acc__card.is-picked{border-color:var(--pv-navy);box-shadow:0 10px 26px -18px rgba(12,30,74,.45);}
    .pe-acc__photo{background:var(--pv-bg-alt);aspect-ratio:1/1;max-width:100%;}
    .pe-acc__photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
    .pe-acc__body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:18px 20px 20px;flex-grow:1;}
    .pe-acc__ref{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pe-zig-ink);}
    .pe-acc__ref--plain{color:var(--pv-gray);}
    .pe-acc__name{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;}
    .pv .pe-acc__why{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--pv-gray);flex-grow:1;}
    .pe-acc__price{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
    .pe-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;align-self:flex-start;}
    .pe-step button{
      width:38px;height:38px;border:none;background:#fff;color:var(--pv-ink);
      font-family:inherit;font-size:19px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;
    }
    .pe-step button:hover:not([disabled]){background:var(--pv-bg-alt);}
    .pe-step button[disabled]{color:var(--pv-line);cursor:not-allowed;}
    .pe-step button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--pv-navy);outline-offset:-2px;}
    .pe-step__qty{
      min-width:42px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;
      font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;border-inline:1px solid var(--pv-line);
      align-self:stretch;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    }

    /* ---- running total bar ---- */
    .pe-total{
      display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
      margin-top:28px;padding:22px 24px;border-radius:18px;
      background:var(--pe-sand);border:1px solid var(--pe-bronze-line);
    }
    .pe-total__k{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pe-bronze);font-weight:700;}
    .pe-total__v{font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:6px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
    .pv .pe-total__d{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:6px;}
    .pe-total__actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;}

    /* ---- inline SIM add ---- */
    .pe-simcta{
      display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
      border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;background:#fff;
    }
    .pe-simcta__t{font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600;}
    .pv .pe-simcta__d{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5;}
    .pe-simcta__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;}

    /* ---- cross-sell photos ----
       The shared core rule puts aspect-ratio and object-fit on the wrapper
       div, where object-fit does nothing. Both Élite cards now carry a
       product shot on white, so the image is centred and contained in the
       4/3 frame instead of being left to its own intrinsic size. */
    .pv-crosssell__photo{
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      padding:16px;background:var(--pe-sand);
    }
    .pv-crosssell__photo img{max-height:100%;width:auto;object-fit:contain;}

    /* ---- hero : visuel et CTA remontés ----
       Le visuel et le CTA passent sous la tagline, le paragraphe
       descriptif sous le CTA. Plafonner la hauteur du visuel est ce qui
       fait réellement entrer le bouton dans le premier écran : les photos
       de pack sont carrées, donc les 640 px de large de la règle partagée
       valent 640 px de haut.

       max-width doit être redonné ici. La règle partagée pose
       width:100%;max-width:640px — passer width à auto sans toucher au
       max-width laissait l'image occuper ses 640 px sur un écran de
       360 px, et elle débordait à droite. Seules des contraintes max sont
       posées, jamais width ni height fixes, pour que le navigateur
       conserve les proportions. */
    .pe-hero{padding-top:72px;}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__summary{margin-top:16px;}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__media{margin-top:34px;}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__media img{
      width:auto;height:auto;
      max-width:min(100%,640px);max-height:min(52vh,520px);
    }
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__cta{margin-top:26px;}
    .pe-hero .pe-hero__chips{margin-top:22px;}
    .pv .pe-hero .pv-hero__sub{
      margin-top:34px;padding-top:30px;border-top:1px solid var(--pe-bronze-line);
      font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,19px);
    }

    /* ---- avis Judge.me ----
       Judge.me sort une liste dense separee par des filets, avec son propre
       chrome en anglais. On la repasse au vocabulaire de la page — cartes,
       ambre, meme typographie — et on masque ce qui fait doublon avec notre
       en-tete ou n'est pas traduit.

       Toutes les regles sont prefixees .pe-judgeme : le widget est le seul
       HTML de cette page que nous n'ecrivons pas, et Judge.me peut le faire
       evoluer sans prevenir. Ce qui ne matche plus se degrade en style par
       defaut, jamais en page cassee. */
    .pe-judgeme{max-width:920px;margin:32px auto 0;text-align:left;}
    .pv .pe-judgeme{font-size:14.5px;}
    /* Judge.me injecte sa feuille de style apres la notre : a specificite
       egale c'est la sienne qui gagne, d'ou le !important sur la couleur
       des etoiles. La couleur de fond du widget se regle chez eux, elle,
       et vaut pour tout le site. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-star{color:var(--pe-amber) !important;}

    /* Masques : le titre et le resume repetent notre en-tete francais ; les
       medailles Judge.me, le tri, les votes "Was this helpful" et le badge
       de transparence restent en anglais tant que les traductions ne sont
       pas renseignees dans leur admin. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev-widg__title,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev-widg__summary,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-medals-wrapper,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev-widg__sort-wrapper,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-write-rev-link,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__actions,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__buyer-badge-wrapper,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__replier-wrapper,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__br{display:none !important;}

    /* Repartition des notes. Que des chiffres, donc rien a traduire ; c'est
       la seule preuve que les 32 avis ne sont pas tous des 5 etoiles. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram{max-width:400px;margin:0 auto 28px;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__row{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:7px;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__star{white-space:nowrap;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:-1px;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__bar{
      flex:1;height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:#e9e9ed;overflow:hidden;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__bar-content{height:100%;background:var(--pe-amber);border-radius:99px;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__percentage{display:none;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__frequency{
      min-width:30px;text-align:right;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-histogram__clear-filter{display:none;}

    /* Un avis = une carte. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev-widg__reviews{display:grid;gap:14px;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev{
      background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:16px;
      padding:20px 22px;margin:0;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,.04);
    }

    /* En-tete : initiale, auteur et pastille sur la premiere ligne, date
       calee a droite, etoiles en dessous. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__header{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px 1fr auto;
      grid-template-areas:"avatar author date" "avatar stars stars";
      column-gap:12px;row-gap:3px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__icon{
      grid-area:avatar;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      background:var(--pe-sand);color:var(--pe-bronze);
      font-weight:700;font-size:15px;line-height:1;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__author-wrapper{grid-area:author;}
    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__author{font-weight:650;color:var(--pv-ink);}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__rating{grid-area:stars;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:-1px;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__timestamp{
      grid-area:date;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);white-space:nowrap;
    }

    /* Le badge natif "Verified buyer" est en anglais et depend de leur
       script. L'attribut data-verified-buyer, lui, est dans le HTML rendu
       cote serveur : on s'en sert pour poser notre propre pastille. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev[data-verified-buyer="true"] .jdgm-rev__author-wrapper::after{
      content:"Achat vérifié";
      display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;vertical-align:1px;
      background:var(--pe-eth-bg);color:var(--pe-eth);
      font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px;
    }

    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__title{
      display:block;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;
      color:var(--pv-ink);margin:0 0 6px;
    }
    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__body{line-height:1.62;}
    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__body p{margin:0 0 10px;}
    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

    /* Repli des avis longs : voir le commentaire du script, en bas de page. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__body{position:relative;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__body.pe-clamped{max-height:10.4em;overflow:hidden;}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__body.pe-clamped::after{
      content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:3.4em;
      background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(255,255,255,0),#fff 85%);
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    .pv .pe-judgeme .pe-more{
      display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:0;border:0;background:none;
      font:inherit;font-weight:650;color:var(--pe-amber);cursor:pointer;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .pe-more:hover{text-decoration:underline;}

    /* Reponse du marchand. Le libelle vient de nous : leur .jdgm-rev__replier
       n'est rempli que si le nom du repondant est configure chez eux, et il
       etait vide ici. */
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__reply-content{
      margin-top:14px;padding:12px 16px;
      background:var(--pv-bg-alt);border-left:3px solid var(--pv-line);
      border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__reply-content::before{
      content:"Réponse de Daewoo Security";
      display:block;font-weight:650;font-size:12.5px;
      color:var(--pv-ink);margin-bottom:6px;
    }
    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__reply-content p{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;}
    .pv .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__reply-content p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__pics img,
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__vids img{border-radius:10px;}

    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-paginate{
      display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:22px;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-paginate__page{
      min-width:34px;height:34px;padding:0 8px;
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      border:1px solid var(--pv-line);border-radius:9px;background:#fff;
      font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-ink);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;
    }
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-paginate__page:hover{border-color:var(--pv-gray);}
    .pe-judgeme .jdgm-paginate__page.jdgm-curt{
      background:var(--pv-navy);border-color:var(--pv-navy);color:#fff;font-weight:650;
    }

    @media (max-width:640px){
      .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev{padding:16px 17px;border-radius:14px;}
      .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__header{
        grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;
        grid-template-areas:"avatar author" "avatar date" "stars stars";
        row-gap:2px;
      }
      .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__icon{width:34px;height:34px;font-size:14px;}
      .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev__timestamp{justify-self:start;}
      .pe-judgeme .jdgm-rev[data-verified-buyer="true"] .jdgm-rev__author-wrapper::after{
        margin-left:6px;font-size:10.5px;
      }
    }
    /* .pv p{margin:0} du CSS de base a la specificite (0,1,1) et ecrasait
       .pv-reviews__summary (0,1,0) : la note collait au titre. On repasse
       par .pv pour remonter au-dessus. */
    .pv .pv-reviews__summary{margin-top:20px;}
    .pv .pe-reviews__note{
      font-size:13.5px;color:var(--pv-gray);margin-top:10px;
      max-width:560px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;
    }
  </style>

  {%- comment -%} Hidden product form shared by every "Add to cart" button on this page {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, data-type: 'add-to-cart-form', is: 'product-form', class: 'pv-visually-hidden' -%}
    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}" id="PEVariantId-{{ section.id }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
    {%- comment -%}
      The theme's ProductForm custom element looks up its own submit button
      with `this.querySelector('[type="submit"]')` — since every real
      "Ajouter au panier" button on this page lives outside this hidden
      form (linked via form="…"), that lookup would return null and throw
      before the cart request is ever sent. This dummy button keeps that
      lookup valid.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <button type="submit" name="add" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
    <div class="product-form__error-message alert alert--error" role="alert" hidden style="position:fixed;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:84px;z-index:70;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e11d48;color:#e11d48;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;"></div>
  {%- endform -%}
  <style>.pv-visually-hidden{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;}</style>

  {%- comment -%} Sticky add-to-cart bar {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pv-sticky" id="PESticky-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="pv-sticky__info">
      <div class="pv-sticky__thumb">
        {%- if hero_image -%}
          {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 80 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '80,160' }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="pv-sticky__text">
        <div class="pv-sticky__name">Pack Élite PA570</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- render 'pv-atc-button', form_id: form_id, variant: variant, label: 'Ajouter au panier', style: 'primary', show_price: true -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Hero. Le H1 est suivi de la seule ligne `summary` — la plus courte et
    la plus concrète, celle qui dit ce qu'il y a dans la boîte — puis du
    visuel, du CTA et des chips. Une version antérieure enchaînait deux
    paragraphes avant la première photo : 350 à 450 px de texte sur
    mobile, et le bouton d'achat encore 700 px plus bas.

    Les chips restent collées au CTA : c'est une ligne de specs
    scannable, elle travaille avec le prix, pas avec le texte narratif.
    Le paragraphe `sub` passe sous le CTA, où il sert de transition vers
    la section « Tout ce qu'il faut, dans une seule boîte ».

    L'ordre ne suffit pas à lui seul : les visuels de pack sont carrés,
    donc 640 px de large valent 640 px de haut et le bouton resterait
    sous la ligne de flottaison sur desktop. La hauteur du visuel est
    plafonnée dans css-extra.liquid.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-hero pe-hero">
    <div class="pv-wrap">
      <span class="pv-eyebrow">Daewoo Security · Pack Élite <span class="pv-ref">{{ variant.sku | default: 'PA570' }}</span></span>
      <h1>Pack alarme Élite PA570 ZenGuard, centrale PA501Z</h1>
      <p class="pv-hero__tagline">La seule centrale de la gamme qui reste pilotable quand la box tombe en panne.</p>
      <p class="pv-hero__summary">Le PA570 comprend une centrale Élite, deux caméras et treize accessoires, soit seize éléments au total.</p>
      {%- if hero_image -%}
        <div class="pv-hero__media pv-reveal">
          {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: id: hero_img_id, loading: 'eager', widths: '600,900,1200', alt: product.title }}
        </div>
        {%- if gallery.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="pv-thumbs" role="group" aria-label="Photos du produit">
            {%- for img in gallery limit: 8 -%}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="pv-thumbs__item{% if img.id == hero_image.id %} is-active{% endif %}"
                data-pe-thumb
                data-full="{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                data-full-srcset="{{ img | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ img | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ img | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w"
                aria-label="Photo {{ forloop.index }} sur {{ gallery.size }}"
              >
                {{ img | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="pv-hero__cta">
        <div id="PEHeroCta-{{ section.id }}">
          {%- render 'pv-atc-button', form_id: form_id, variant: variant, label: 'Ajouter au panier', style: 'primary', show_price: true -%}
        </div>
        <div class="pv-hero__price">
          <span class="pv-price-compare{% if variant_has_compare %} is-visible{% endif %}">{{ variant.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
          <strong class="pv-price-amount">{{ variant.price | money }}</strong> · paiement sécurisé
        </div>
        {%- render 'pv-trust-row', has_rating: has_rating, rating_value: rating_value, rating_max: rating_max, rating_count: rating_count, rating_pct: rating_pct, reviews_anchor: reviews_anchor -%}
      </div>
      <div class="pe-hero__chips">
        <span class="pe-chip pe-chip--zig">Zigbee 3.0</span>
        <span class="pe-chip pe-chip--eth">Port RJ45</span>
        <span class="pe-chip pe-chip--4g">4G+ données</span>
        <span class="pe-chip">Batterie 10&nbsp;h</span>
        <span class="pe-chip">Jusqu'à 200 accessoires</span>
      </div>
      <p class="pv-hero__sub">Centrale PA501Z multiprotocole — Ethernet, Wi-Fi, 4G+ et passerelle Zigbee 3.0 — accompagnée
        de 13 accessoires dont 9 capteurs Zigbee, deux caméras et une sirène extérieure solaire.
        Installation sans technicien, sans travaux, sans abonnement obligatoire.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  {%- comment -%} Trust strip {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pv-wrap">
    <div class="pv-strip pv-reveal">
      <div class="pv-strip__item">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
        Installation sans technicien ni câblage
      </div>
      <div class="pv-strip__item">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
        Sans abonnement obligatoire
      </div>
      <div class="pv-strip__item">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
        Compatible gamme SA501 et Zigbee
      </div>
      <div class="pv-strip__item">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
        Garantie 2 ans, SAV en France
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Pack contents {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-section">
    <div class="pv-wrap">
      <div class="pv-contents__head pv-reveal">
        <h2>Tout ce qu'il faut, dans une seule boîte</h2>
        <p>13 accessoires et deux caméras, pensés pour une maison avec beaucoup d'ouvertures vitrées.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pv-contents__grid pv-reveal">
        <div class="pv-contents__item">
          <span class="pv-contents__qty">1×</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pv-contents__name">Centrale Élite PA501Z</div>
            <div class="pv-contents__desc">Ethernet RJ45, Wi-Fi 2,4 GHz, 4G+ (carte SIM en option), passerelle Zigbee 3.0. Batterie de secours 10&nbsp;h.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-contents__item">
          <span class="pv-contents__qty">1×</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pv-contents__name">Caméra intérieure motorisée IP506P</div>
            <div class="pv-contents__desc">Rotation 360°, auto-tracking, vision nocturne. Objectif qui se rétracte physiquement en mode Vie Privée. Alimentation secteur.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-contents__item">
          <span class="pv-contents__qty">1×</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pv-contents__name">Caméra extérieure autonome W503</div>
            <div class="pv-contents__desc">100 % sans fil, batterie longue durée, Full HD, vision nocturne couleur avec projecteur intégré.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-contents__item">
